specifiers, not secrets; `formatBuildMessages` also runs positions through `relForDisplay`. The one genuinely raw datum is `css-bundle-failed`'s `cssPath`, which skips `relForDisplay` at ComponentRegistry.ts:274 and would print an absolute path — a nit-level hardening item, not a MEDIUM information-disclosure vulnerability."
